OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric crane returns as part of
OL,4,A#420k project
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historic crane has returned to its
OL,7,Fhome on a canal's waterfront after
OL,8,Fundergoing specialist conservation
OL,9,Fwork.
OL,11,FThe crane has been reinstated at its
OL,12,Fhome in the wharf alongside the Kennet
OL,13,Fand Avon Canal as part of a #420,000
OL,14,Fproject to complete Newbury's new Peace
OL,15,FGarden area.
OL,17,FWest Berkshire Council said the wood
OL,18,Fhad been treated and preserved, while
OL,19,Fthe ironwork had been cleaned, repaired
OL,20,Fand freshly repainted.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
